### ==================== AUTH ====================

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/authenticate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@zenyatlas.com",
  "senha": "12345678"
}

### Registrar usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Nome Completo",
  "email": "usuario@email.com",
  "senha": "senha123",
  "tipoUsuario": "CLIENTE"
}

### ==================== CLIENTES ====================

### Cadastrar cliente
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Nome Cliente",
  "email": "cliente@email.com",
  "senha": "senha123"
}

### Listar pedidos do cliente
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/clientes/1/pedidos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==================== PEDIDOS ====================

### Criar pedido
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pedidos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "clienteId": 1,
  "destinoId": 1,
  "formaPagamento": 150.00
}

