### ==================== USUÁRIOS ====================

### Listar usuários
GET {{baseUrl}}/usuarios

### Buscar usuário por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/usuarios/1

### Criar usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Nome",
  "email": "email@email.com",
  "senha": "senha123",
  "tipoUsuario": "CLIENTE"
}

### ==================== ADMINS ====================

### Listar admins
GET {{baseUrl}}/admins
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/admins
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nome": "Admin",
  "email": "admin@email.com",
  "senha": "admin123",
  "tipoUsuario": "ADMIN"
}

